{"title":"2026 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 CEMC Galois Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A <i>prime number</i> is a positive integer greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> whose only positive divisors are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and itself. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is a prime number since it is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and its only positive divisors are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are two integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/3/b93462984543d7197e9a81fb2839c56fa7287ae3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq c \\leq 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"85\" height=\"16\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/e/a8e9c294202833c60f99368226da65a9e98f9f91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c - 3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"45\" height=\"38\" /> is a prime number. What are these two possible values of the integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/9/fb9e4364e228ec6356b61a5d53509ea1167c6cf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" /> divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> must be a prime number, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/9/fb9e4364e228ec6356b61a5d53509ea1167c6cf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" /> must be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> (inclusive), so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> can be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/4/364e73f027e00a6cc83380babf2678597bba5df9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/3/aa38edf6e1f4dda0da27d7f422419e3081dee485.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c - 3}{4} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" />, which is not prime.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/8/4180920f7b814184d4bd9e5d514cb86910cfb250.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 7$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/e/10e7bb86b7e4a7f794e95c8a4971f09cd0ed4cd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c - 3}{4} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" />, which is not prime.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/1/2a14feb8723914a3ef109c8ff5ce8871141f66f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/e/a2ec3e95046f77594bedebfa9608de0d8decda1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c - 3}{4} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" />, which is prime.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/f/1ff09f194c049d9325449ba166b4f4118fa1ad06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/7/9c7c67a5892933b8a0efa63e6650ecef1f69b47e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c - 3}{4} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" />, which is prime.\n</p><p>Thus, the two values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/e/a8e9c294202833c60f99368226da65a9e98f9f91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c - 3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"45\" height=\"38\" /> is prime and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/3/b93462984543d7197e9a81fb2839c56fa7287ae3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq c \\leq 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"85\" height=\"16\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/9/8b948b229508ba861568e36fef0f6c0c241be685.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{c = 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"63\" height=\"25\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d106e376ae87206b5c404921257651eddba1bf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{c = 15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"63\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that the smallest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/e/a8e9c294202833c60f99368226da65a9e98f9f91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c - 3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"45\" height=\"38\" /> occurs when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/5/5351998230e216d9d0f2884c159326cfe6622263.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> and the highest possible value occurs when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/5/0d55e0c96dbbfc51bef992dd29587f7cb26330e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/5/5351998230e216d9d0f2884c159326cfe6622263.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3ad34f492ac4f6cbc781ec395d473822126404ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c - 3}{4} = \\frac{1 - 3}{4} = \\frac{-1}{2} &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"198\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/5/0d55e0c96dbbfc51bef992dd29587f7cb26330e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/5/885df307b581c9e33c8e9331c166e1abac13bb84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c - 3}{4} = \\frac{17 - 3}{4} = \\frac{7}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"160\" height=\"38\" />, which is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The two prime numbers in this range are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/e/a2ec3e95046f77594bedebfa9608de0d8decda1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c - 3}{4} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/7/9c7c67a5892933b8a0efa63e6650ecef1f69b47e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c - 3}{4} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/7/327e07a041dfe6222a7f5624b569e3cd8d22e704.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c - 3 = 2 \\times 4 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/9/22907b523527da6f64470f7d430f59d56f29ff3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c - 3 = 3 \\times 4 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/1/f51fb8954fc7fcb9d2e379f639eab04ee08ac5d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 8 + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/1/3b19e20615da62bcc467a84f13e42533b28ceb9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 12 + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/9/8b948b229508ba861568e36fef0f6c0c241be685.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{c = 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"63\" height=\"25\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d106e376ae87206b5c404921257651eddba1bf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{c = 15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"63\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034701\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 238/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 477/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9802/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.920      1 2026_CEMC_Galois_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    6.920      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36905:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018034701 and revision id 285671. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}